---
layout: base.njk
title: "Teams | MX-5 Mk4 Trophy"
ogTitle: "MX-5 Mk4 Trophy teams"
description: "The teams running cars in the MX-5 Mk4 Trophy. Arrive and drive, car sales and race preparation, with contact details for each."
permalink: /teams/index.html
---
{% set teams = collections.teams | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}

<section class="band band--dark newshead">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Race with us</p>
    <h1 class="newshead__h">Teams</h1>
    <p class="teamsintro">The teams running cars in the championship. Most will put you in a car for a test day before you commit to anything, and all of them would rather have that conversation early than sell you a season you are not ready for.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="shell">
    {% if teams.length %}
    <div class="teams">
      {% for team in teams %}
      <article class="team">
        <div class="team__logo">
          {% if team.data.logo %}
            <img src="{{ team.data.logo }}" alt="{{ team.data.name }}" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
            <span class="team__mark">{{ team.data.name }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="team__body">
          <h2 class="team__name">{{ team.data.name }}</h2>
          {% if team.data.base %}<p class="team__base">{{ team.data.base }}</p>{% endif %}

          {% if team.data.services.length %}
          <ul class="team__tags">
            {% for s in team.data.services %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}

          {% if team.data.blurb %}<p class="team__blurb">{{ team.data.blurb }}</p>{% endif %}

          <ul class="team__contact">
            {% if team.data.website %}<li><a href="{{ team.data.website }}" rel="noopener">Website</a></li>{% endif %}
            {% if team.data.email %}<li><a href="mailto:{{ team.data.email }}">{{ team.data.email }}</a></li>{% endif %}
            {% if team.data.phone %}<li><a href="tel:{{ team.data.phone | replace(' ','') }}">{{ team.data.phone }}</a></li>{% endif %}
            {% if not team.data.website and not team.data.email and not team.data.phone %}
              <li class="team__nocontact">[Contact details to be added]</li>
            {% endif %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="tbc">
      <p class="tbc__flag">To be confirmed</p>
      <h2 class="tbc__h">The team list is being finalised.</h2>
      <p class="tbc__p">We are confirming which teams will run cars, and we would rather publish nothing than publish a list that changes a fortnight later. It will be here as soon as it is settled.</p>
      <p class="tbc__p">In the meantime, tell us what you are looking for and we will put you in touch with the right people directly.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--lg" href="/#enquire">Register your interest</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="shell cta__in">
    <div>
      <h2>Not sure which team suits you?</h2>
      <p>Tell us your budget and how much seat time you have had, and we will point you at the two or three worth calling.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--lg btn--ink" href="/#enquire">Ask us</a>
  </div>
</section>
